{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassEndomorphism.WhippleRotationIntertwining","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassEndomorphism.WhippleRotationIntertwining","imports":["lean:module:Init"],"declarations":21,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.channelIndexed_swaps_windings","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.channelIndexed_swaps_windings","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L133-L146","doc":"**The reduction.** For a channel-indexed ladder, the winding-swap field of\n`WhippleRotationIntertwining` is *derived* from the channel flip — no swap is\nassumed. Because both gradings are the same `windOf` of their channel index,\nflipping the indices flips the gradings. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.ChannelIndexedLadder.toWindingLadder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.ChannelIndexedLadder.toWindingLadder","kind":"def","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L125-L131","doc":"The winding-graded ladder induced by a channel-indexed ladder: each grading\nis `windOf` of the corresponding channel index. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.ChannelIndexedLadder.rot_flips_channels","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.ChannelIndexedLadder.rot_flips_channels","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L122-L122","doc":"`rot` flips the even and odd channel indices: the faithful abstraction of\n`rotation_step`'s `oddStep ↔ evenStep` carry. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.ChannelIndexedLadder.windOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.ChannelIndexedLadder.windOf","kind":"def","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L119-L119","doc":"winding grading assigned to a channel index (the SAME map for both\nchannels — this is what makes the swap derivable). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.ChannelIndexedLadder.rot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.ChannelIndexedLadder.rot","kind":"def","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L116-L116","doc":"the ζ₄ channel rotation (abstract shadow of `rotation_step`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.ChannelIndexedLadder.oddIdx","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.ChannelIndexedLadder.oddIdx","kind":"def","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L114-L114","doc":"odd (non-compact / `𝔔_β` / `sinh`) recurrence-channel index. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.ChannelIndexedLadder.evenIdx","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.ChannelIndexedLadder.evenIdx","kind":"def","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L112-L112","doc":"even (compact / binding / `cosh`) recurrence-channel index. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.ChannelIndexedLadder.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.ChannelIndexedLadder.mk","kind":"ctor","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L110-L110","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.ChannelIndexedLadder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.ChannelIndexedLadder","kind":"structure","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L107-L123","doc":"Channel-indexed ladder data: the two recurrence-channel indices, the\nchannel-flipping rotation (shadow of `rotation_step`), and the shared\nwinding function assigning a grading to a channel index. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.gradingPair_intertwines_swap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.gradingPair_intertwines_swap","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L72-L86","doc":"**Derived intertwining (provable modulo the class).** The winding-grading\nmap `x ↦ (μ(x), ν(x))` intertwines the channel rotation `rot` with the\ncoordinate swap `Prod.swap`: for every ladder state, the grading pair of\n`rot x` is the swap of the grading pair of `x`. This is the exact\ncategorical shadow of the Whipple degree–order exchange\n`(μ, ν) ↦ (ν, μ)`; it is a genuine *consequence* of the class fields\n(the two swap components), not a restatement of them, and holds for any\ninstance without providing one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.nuGrade_square","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.nuGrade_square","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L63-L70","doc":"Companion of `grading_square` for the along-loop winding: the along-loop\ngrading is also restored after a double rotation. Together the two say\nthe winding pair `(μ, ν)` is fixed by `rot²`, as the Whipple square\nrequires. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.grading_square","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.grading_square","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L54-L61","doc":"Sanity (provable, not part of the conjecture): the two grading-swap\nconditions plus involutivity are mutually consistent — swapping twice\nreturns both gradings. Stated to keep the class honest: the fields are\nnot vacuous and compose as the Whipple square should. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.WhippleRotationIntertwining.rot_involutive_on_ladder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.WhippleRotationIntertwining.rot_involutive_on_ladder","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L52-L52","doc":"The rotation is involutive on ladder states, matching the exact\ninvolutivity of the Whipple argument exchange cosh ↔ coth. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.WhippleRotationIntertwining.rot_swaps_windings","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.WhippleRotationIntertwining.rot_swaps_windings","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L47-L47","doc":"The rotation exchanges the around-core and along-loop windings —\nthe Whipple degree–order swap. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.WhippleRotationIntertwining.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.WhippleRotationIntertwining.mk","kind":"ctor","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L44-L44","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.WhippleRotationIntertwining","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.WhippleRotationIntertwining","kind":"class","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L38-L52","doc":"**Conjecture (primary): Whipple–rotation intertwining.** The channel\nrotation acts on winding-graded ladder data as the Whipple degree–order\nexchange: it swaps the two winding gradings and squares to the\nidentity on ladder states. An instance for the toroidal channel family\nof a bound vortex pair would realise the identification; none is\nprovided — the conjecture is open. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:whipple-rotation-intertwining","label":"conj:whipple-rotation-intertwining","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.WindingLadderData.nuGrade","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.WindingLadderData.nuGrade","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L36-L36","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.WindingLadderData.muGrade","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.WindingLadderData.muGrade","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.WindingLadderData.rot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.WindingLadderData.rot","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L34-L34","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.WindingLadderData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.WindingLadderData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L33-L33","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.WindingLadderData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.WindingLadderData","kind":"structure","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/whipple-rotation-intertwining.lean#L29-L36","doc":"Winding-graded channel-ladder data: a carrier `M` of ladder states with\nthe two winding gradings — `muGrade` (around-core) and `nuGrade`\n(along-loop) — and the fibre-level channel rotation `rot` (the\narchimedean shadow of the `rotation_step` map `(x, q) ↦ (ix, q⁻¹)`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}